block w-60 break-all py-1 text-sm cursor-pointer text-secondary hover:text-primary" data-inspector="inspector_footer_Whistleblower"><span style="padding:4px 0px;display:inline-block">Whistleblower Contact</span><section class="hidden absolute bottom-full start-[120px] -translate-x-1/2 rtl:translate-x-0 rtl:start-auto rtl:end-0 bg-default w-60 overflow-hidden rounded-xl break-words p-3 shadow-[0px_4px_16px_rgba(0,0,0,0.08)] list-none after:absolute after:w-0 after:h-0 after:left-[30px] rtl:after:left-auto rtl:after:right-[30px] after:bottom-[-6px] after:border-[6px] after:border-solid after:border-transparent after:border-b-0 after:content-[&#x27;&#x27;] after:[border-top-color:#fff] group-hover:block" data-inspector="inspector_footer_Whistleblower_children"><h4 class="mt-0 mb-1 text-sm leading-[22px] font-medium text-secondary">If you discover any of the following:</h4><ol class="m-0 list-none p-0"><li class="text-xs leading-5 font-normal text-secondary">1. Offering/accepting bribes.</li><li class="text-xs leading-5 font-normal text-secondary">2. Fraud or falsification.</li><li class="text-xs leading-5 font-normal text-secondary">3. Breach of confidentiality.</li><li class="text-xs leading-5 font-normal text-secondary">4. Theft of assets.</li><li class="text-xs leading-5 font-normal text-secondary">5. Theft of resources.</li><li class="text-xs leading-5 font-normal text-secondary">6. Illegal transfer of interests.</li><li class="text-xs leading-5 font-normal text-secondary">7. Other misconduct.</li></ol><h4 class="mt-[14px] text-sm leading-[22px] font-medium text-primary">Rewards will be provided to users who inform us of the above. Reward amounts will be determined based on the type and relevance of the information provided. Your personal information will be kept confidential.</h4><p class="m-0 text-xs leading-5 font-normal text-primary">Whistleblower Contact: <a class="!inline !w-auto !p-0 !text-xs !h-auto !leading-[inherit] !text-link align-baseline" target="_bla